WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:05.859
Well, it had to happen eventually, the frustration
from being unable to send out his screeds

00:00:05.859 --> 00:00:11.390
and diatribes via Twitter was going to get
to former President Donald Trump.

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:18.609
And there's a report from The Daily Beast
that Trump is so frustrated from being unable

00:00:18.609 --> 00:00:25.800
to send out insults on Twitter because he's
banned, that he's been writing down insults

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:30.119
and giving them to aides and asking them to
tweet the messages out.

00:00:30.119 --> 00:00:33.539
This is being reported by The Daily Beast.

00:00:33.539 --> 00:00:39.700
Sources close to Trump said to The Daily Beast
that Trump was really, really upset.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:40.989
I'm so wound up about the story.

00:00:40.989 --> 00:00:46.460
I just threw my Sharpie, the entire Liz Cheney
thing where there was a referendum within

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:50.879
the Republican Party about Liz Cheney and
whether she should retain her leadership role

00:00:50.879 --> 00:00:52.510
or not.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:57.910
And you might recall that Liz Cheney was one
of the 10 Republicans in the House that back

00:00:57.910 --> 00:01:02.750
in January voted to impeach Donald Trump in
the House of Representatives, now leading

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:06.140
to his upcoming second impeachment trial.

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:08.850
And this entire time, Trump couldn't tweet.

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:10.189
He was desperate to tweet.

00:01:10.189 --> 00:01:13.560
He was desperate to attack his political opponents.

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:20.659
And what is being reported is that Trump has,
quote, written out insults and observations,

00:01:20.659 --> 00:01:23.010
several of them about Liz Cheney.

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:28.899
I assume some are about her physical appearance
because it's Trump and has resorted to suggesting

00:01:28.899 --> 00:01:35.380
put downs for others to use or post to their
own Twitter accounts.

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:42.479
And I mean, this is you know, it's so ridiculous
and childish, but completely obvious that,

00:01:42.479 --> 00:01:47.899
you know, I was thinking Trump Trump almost
seems more upset about not being able to tweet

00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:50.080
than he is about not being president anymore.

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:54.610
And then I thought, well, he might actually
believe he still is the rightful president

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:57.939
because he believes it was supposedly stolen
by Joe Biden.

00:01:57.939 --> 00:02:01.090
Trump seems to know he's definitely banned
from Twitter.

00:02:01.090 --> 00:02:06.950
I have this image of Trump sitting at Mar
a Lago or wherever he is, I don't even know

00:02:06.950 --> 00:02:12.640
with construction paper and crayons, but not
the thin crayons, the fat ones, where, like,

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:17.410
it's impossible to write anything coherently,
sitting there writing out insults with one

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:21.569
of the fat crayons in a piece of construction
paper and seeing who might be willing to tweet

00:02:21.569 --> 00:02:22.569
it out.

00:02:22.569 --> 00:02:27.550
I think we'll know if Trump's written screeds
are getting out on Twitter.

00:02:27.550 --> 00:02:33.060
Like if we see Steven Miller tweet that little
Marco Rubio isn't really a patriot or something

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:38.510
about Ted Cruz's wife's physical appearance
will know that it's probably not really Steven

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:39.510
Miller tweeting.

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:41.680
It's probably actually Donald Trump.

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:49.190
And as we observed during the presidency,
this is a man, Trump, who seems to have like

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:53.709
a bottomless reflex or a desire to just insult
people.

00:02:53.709 --> 00:02:55.739
It comes so naturally to him.

00:02:55.739 --> 00:02:59.690
And a lot of it, from what we know, seems
to come from from his childhood in the way

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:05.819
he was raised and the relationship with his
dad not to get all all Freudian.

00:03:05.819 --> 00:03:10.900
And it's it's really the type of pathetic
behavior that just reminds us again that this

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:14.870
guy never had the temperament to be president
of the United States.

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:19.400
And we think back to Hillary Clinton during
the debates in 2016 who said this man is temperamentally

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:21.110
unfit to be president.

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:24.170
And of course, she was completely right.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:33.599
And for the last, what was it, few weeks,
I guess a month or so of Trump being on Twitter?

00:03:33.599 --> 00:03:35.599
More than more than half, certainly.

00:03:35.599 --> 00:03:40.550
I don't know what percentage of his tweets
were being labeled either misleading or were

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:46.159
restricted by Twitter for either spreading
conspiracy theories or making false claims

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:49.080
about elections or whatever the case may be.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:55.460
And now we are seeing a real rift in the Republican
Party where you have lawmakers who want to

00:03:55.460 --> 00:04:01.320
completely get rid of even Trump almost like
a race trump from history and get rid of his

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:02.379
influence.

00:04:02.379 --> 00:04:08.550
And then you have this other side, the Marjorie
Taylor Greene, Lauren Bobert side, that seems

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:13.819
determined to keep Trump ism going to to some
degree.

00:04:13.819 --> 00:04:18.770
And that's what led to this movement within
the Republican Party to try to remove Congresswoman

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:26.680
Liz Cheney and anti Trump or at least a Trump
skeptical Republican from a position of power.

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:27.680
It failed.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:28.810
It failed.

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:35.780
And throughout all of this, Donald Trump reportedly
very pleased with Marjorie Taylor Greene,

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:40.450
desperate to get somebody to tweet out the
insults that he's been coming up with.

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:44.850
So I don't know what else to tell you, but
Trump behaving exactly as we would expect

00:04:44.850 --> 00:05:40.500
him 

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:46.880
to behave.

